Z||000015||AusFiero||07-05-2001||07:35 PM||||Guy was doing about 90K's or about 55 MPH the article says.<P>The engine, look closely at picture 2, it is under the guard rail.<P>Yes we do get a lot of model cars you don't get, particularly the Japanese and European that don't make it to your shores.<P>Our Japanese cars are probably what many would consider pretty decent actually. We even have our own Australian Jap cars developed here, built here, but carry a Mitsubishi badge. <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
