Z||000021||BC-GT||07-06-2001||07:06 PM||||Wow, my first car, 144 CI six w/3 on the tree, slower than molasses in January.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p42f9a24472680881d35ceb5f5d62243d/fe5e206d.jpg.orig.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||AusFiero||07-06-2001||08:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Steve Normington:<BR><B> He was only doing 55 mph and did that to the car?!? What is it made out of, aluminum foil?!?<P>PS. In Australia, do you say aluminum with 4 syllables (a lum i num) or five (al u min i um)?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think it was just sheer dumb luck. Guardrail went beside the engine and didn't leave a lot of metal to punch through. Test you average firewall with a big screwdriver and some force and you will see what I mean.<P>Hmmm how to pronounce Aluminum. We say it Ally Min Yum. Thats breaking it down, it flows better as a single word. So I suppose that breaks down into al i min um. So 4 syllables  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ford does indeed have an engine plant here that still makes 302 and 351s. <P>The Chrysler Hemi is actually not the Hemi you are thinking of. We had a 6 cyl straight six called the hemi,  or the slant 6. It is a pretty powerful engine none the less and when put in a E-38 Chrysler Charger with triple dual throat webbers was quite a performance package. <P>Poor thing just didn't have much of a chance in the 70s though when it was up against cars like the Holden Monaro 350 and the legendary Ford Falcon GT HO Phase III.<P>Next year we are getting back our 350 Holden Monaro and our Ford GTs. The Monaro is based on a Holden Commodore coupe model they are releasing. Also rumoured to be your F-Body replacement eventually. Ford not to be outdone have gone coupe on the car you see smashed above and are re-releasing GT's. But as 2 doors this time around not 4 door touring sedans.<P>Our makers have 1 aim with high performance cars basically. Prove yourself at the Bathurst 1000 race and your got a year of sales. <P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
Z||000023||BC-GT||07-06-2001||08:41 PM||||Yeah, thats it, thats what mine was, a 1962 Ford Falcon GT HO Phase II POS <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
